<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Kwamashi</book>
  <para style="h">2 KORINTE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Paulu dyo Muthsidi kwa AkwaKorinte</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 AkwaKorinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Kor</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dya Paulu dyo Muthsidi kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">AkwaKorinte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="rem">TA, MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Edi diñoro dyaa tunda kwa Paulu, kanganda ka Krisitu Yesu keshima ya Nyambi, noku kwa muenthzetu Timoti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Naa ñorera kereke thza Nyambi mu Korinte, mofoci kengeyo nakwakutawa wahe o mu Akaya momuhe.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Thsihemo no thsiyaro thsa Nyambi Tata wetu na Fumu Yesu Krisitu ikare nenu.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa kanderera kwa Nyambi munyima thzo makando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Ku shangariwe Nyambi, aye Tata wa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu, Tata o thsidirañeke no Nyambi ohengawethzo ouhe, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />aye oyu na tu hengawethzanga mu makando etu oahe ci natwe tu twethse ku hengawethza awa a di mu makando kohengawethzo ou naa tu pa Nyambi. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Inene dyodi tu nyandera nene Krisitu, nohengawethzo wetu dyo u kura nene ka Krisitu. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Ngeci atwepo tu nyanda twaa nyandera amwe ci mu wane ohengawethzo no kuyoyithsiwa! Inene yoihe tu hengawethziwa, natwe kenge twa ku mi hengawethza, mweyo mwaa piwa okoro o ku cithzua no ku kwata mucima o ku mu di mu makando o ku cishoka noa tu di nao. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Okurupero wetu ku kwenu po u koro, inene tu na dimuka ci dyodi mu ciera mu makando etu, dyo mwa ku ciera muhengawethzo wetu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Andengenu, twaa fota ci mu dimuke yo makando aa twa kekarire nao mu Asia. Shime twa kekarire mukaru nene, o ku piterera okoro othzui wetu, mane shime twaa anekera ci ka twa ku yoya karo. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Yoshemwa, shime twaa ciyuva eci na tu ratweriwa kufa. Unone yoihe eyi shime na i tendahara ci twa cikurupera twathsinda, unone tu kurupere Nyambi oyu na pinduranga afu. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Karo yodiyo na a tu amwena kukaru o ku twethsa ku twara ku kufa, karo kenge a ku tu amwena. Pa penthzi podiyo tu na paka okurupero wetu ci kenge a ku twarerera ku tu amwena. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Namwe mu tu kwathse ko ku tu romberera, ci anu owangi a ku kanderere kwa Nyambi mukaci ko thsihemo ethsi naa tu pa mu kutawa erombero yanu owangi.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa pirura eanekera yenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Kucishangara kwetu po oku, mumoneno wetu waa pa ombangi nawa, nenepo keyi yenu, twa yoyire mu kaye ko mikarero thzothziwa no kupira kapongonyi. Na tu tende kengeyo kadi ko ku tanarera ponyanyami o kaye, unone pa thsihemo thsa Nyambi. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Inene ka tu mi ñorerire enu eyi mu kana ku twethsa ku tara nji ku yuvithsithsa. Naa kurupera ci kenge mwa ku yuvithsithsa ko kuyara, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />enu eyi mu yuvithsithsa kamanana pano, ci mu diyuwa dya Fumu Yesu mwa ku twethse ku cishangara mukaci ketu eci edi twa ku cishangara natwe mukaci kenu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Pakuninga ci na tawire shemwa eyi, na ni foto ci na ni mi hungerithse tango ci nga mwa ku tambure thsiyauthzi rwidi. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Shime na ni foto ku na mi hungerithsa o ku ni thza ku Masedonia, nou nga na ku ka huka ku Masedonia ci nga mwa ku na ni kwathse mu ruendo rwange ro ku thza ku Judea.<verse eid="2CO 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ene ka na ni anekera nawa ou na ni ceke ku tenda kengeyo nji? Inji naa kwama esheteka yange konu, ku ciroithsera ku amba “Ii, ii” no “Dyombo, dyombo” mu thsikati thsofoci? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Dyodi a na rurama Nyambi, diywi dyetu ku kwenu po kadi ci ngwa dya “Ii” no “Dyombo.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Inene Yesu Krisitu, aye Mwana Nyambi oyu na tu mi hongo, ame na Silasi na Timoti, kadi ci ngwa wa “Ii” no “Dyombo,” unone ku kwenthzi thsikati thsothsihe po “Ii.” <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Inene yoihe ekumbwethzo ya Nyambi po “Ii” mwa Krisitu. Karo ngeyi tu na amberanga “Ameni” wetu kenthzi ku shangara kutethzima kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="2CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Uno honi Nyambi po yodiyo na tu thziimekanga atwe namwe mwa Krisitu. Yodiyo karo naa tu wethse, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />na a tu paka thsitamba ku tu tenda anuenthzi shemwa no ku paka Mupepo Oukenu mu micima thzetu kwikara thsitanarithso thseyi a kumbwethzire.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Unone naethsa Nyambi kwikara mbangi wange, ka ni miangerire. Eyi na ni kana ku hukera oko ku Korinte po ka na ni foto ku mi retera karo makando. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Kadi ci ngwa twaa fota ku endithsa thsitawo thsenu, unone twaa fota ci tu kwamene pofoci nenu ci mwikare no thsinyanyu, inene mu na tanara mu thsitawo thsenu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="rem">TA, MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Inene na ni i cikupura ci na ku na mi hungerithsa ko ku na mi korithsa ku micima karo. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Inene ngeci naa mi korithsa ku micima, edye oyu nga o ni roerithsa ngeci kadi shime oyu ni na yuvithsa ku kora ku mucima? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Na ñorire eci edi na ñorire ci ou na ku keya nga na ku na yuvithsiwa kukora ku mucima kowa a na roera ku ni roerithsa. Inene na rakwire ci ku kwenu mwahe, kuroera kwange po kuroera kwenu namwe mwahe. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Inene na mi ñorerire ko ku kora nene ku mucima no thsorokoto no mihothzi thzothzingi. Kadi cingwa shime na fotire ku mi yuvithsa ku kora ku micima unone shime na fotire ku mi monithsa edi na mi shima nene.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyu nepithsa a teteriwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Uno honi ngeci kwaa di oyu naa reta kukora ku mucima, ame ka a ni korithsire nene ku mucima unone yamwe mwahe a na korithsa nene ku micima, eyo tumba ni i koño. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Munu o kengeyo, humbithso ethzi na a piwa kwanu owangi thzi na mu kwana. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Pano honi, mwaa roera ku mu tetera no ku mu hengawethza, ci katere a ku othziwe ku mathsiwa oakuru nene. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Mweyo, naa mi adikanena ci mu mu monithse ketenda ci mwakwa ku mu shima.<verse eid="2CO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Eyo ngeyi na mi ñorerire ku mi ereka ku mona ci kenge nga mu shupwera eraerera yange ko kuyara. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Yomuhe oyu mu na kwatera, name naa mu kwatera. Karo ngeci naa kwatera ethsi thsi na roera ku kwateriwa, naa tenda kengeyo pa meho a Krisitu mukaci kenu, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />ci Satana a twethsa ku tu nyanyamena. Inene tu na dimuka nawa esheteka yenthzi yoimango.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuothza mwa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Ou na ka kumine mu Toroasi ku ka honga Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Krisitu, na ka wanine ci Fumu naa ni yanthzurwera thsero. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Uno honi ka na ka ciyarire nawa mukaci ko kuninga ci muenthzange Tite ka na ka mu waninemo. Mweyo, na wa thsiarithsirepo no ku thza ku Masedonia.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Uno honi ku kandereriwe Nyambi, oyu na tu tangereranga thsikati thsothsihe mwa Krisitu mu kuothza no ku cikwathsithsa atwe ku kuwa odimukero wa Krisitu kokuhe, eci munuko ouwa. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Inene yatwe twa munuko ouwa wa Krisitu kwa Nyambi mu kaci kowa a yoyithsiwa nowa a cithzira. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Kwamweya po twa munuko ou u reta kufa, kwamweya po twa munuko ou u reta mwoyo. Edye o ku twethsa ku kwama enu yo kenge?<verse eid="2CO 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Ka tu cipiturire nanu amweya awa a honga diywi dya Nyambi ko ku fota ku wanenapo. Unone atwe twaa di honga koshemwa nokoro wa Krisitu, ko kwikara awa naa tumu Nyambi ko ku dimuka ci Nyambi na tu tanekera.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="rem">TA, MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Akwakukwama o thsiyuvano thsothsipe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Ene twaa tateka ku cishangara twathsinda karo nji? Inji kwaa fotahara mañoro ombangi aa a keya ku kwenu nji aa a tunda ku kwenu eci edi a na tendanga amweya? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Yoyamwe mwene yamwe mwa diñoro dyetu dyo ku tu dimukaharithsa, edi di na ñoriwa mu micima thzetu, edi di na dimukiwa no ku variwa kwanu wahe. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Mwaa monithsa ci mwa diñoro edi di tunda kwa Krisitu, edi na di ñoriwa kekwama yetu. Ka na di ñoriwa ko enge unone ko Mupepo wa Nyambi oyu yoya, ka na di ñoriwa pa mathzo, unone mu micima thzanu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Twaa amba kengeyo inene tu na rakwa yoshemwa Nyambi ka Krisitu. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Ka tu cishimbire cingwa twaa twethsa ku kwama enu yoihe kokoro wetu, unone Nyambi yodiyo tu pa okoro. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Yodiyo naa tu twethsithsa ci twikare akwakukwama o thsiyuvano thsothsipe. Ethsi thsiyuvano po ka di cingwa murao o ku ñoriwa, unone thsa Mupepo. Murao o ku ñoriwa waepaa, unone Mupepo ao waa pa mwoyo.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutethzima ko thsiyuvano thsothsipe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Kwameno thziya thza retire kufa shime thza cakuriwire ko mataku pa mathzo o mawe. Thza keyire ko kutethzima ko kuninga ci mane Maisiraele ka twethsire ku kenga pa rupara rwa Mushe mukaci ko kutethzima kwathzo shaanga ci shime kwa thzire o pwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Athzo honi kwameno thzo Mupepo ne? Kadi kenge thza kwikara no kutethzima kokukuru kupita apo? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Inene ngeci kwameno thzo murao thziya thza retire raturo thzekarire no kutethzima, athzo kwameno ethzi thzi reta owawa ne thzi di no kutethzima ko ku kuma kupi! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Mane kuya kutethzima ko kutanga po kadi kutethzima, ku ku anekethza no kutethzima ko kupiterera oko. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ngeci ethsi thsekarireko thsikati thsothsipu pohuma thsekarire no kutethzima, ethsi thsa kwikarako diyere ne kadi kenge thsa kwikara no kutethzima kokukuru kupita thso kutanga!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Mweyo, pakuninga ci tu di nokurupero o kengeyo, tu di nondume. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Ka tu cipiturire na Mushe oyu wa thsikire rupara rwenthzi no thsito ci Maisiraele katere a mone kutethzima o ku ku pwa ku rupara rwenthzi. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Unone maano o a karupithsiwire, mane no pano tu di thsiyuvano thso kare yoihe thsi variwa, ethso thsito thsaa thsika maano o, inene ethso thsito thsaa twethsa pohuma ku tundithsiwa ko ku tawa kwa Krisitu. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Yoshemwa, no rerodino yoihe a tara eñora ya Mushe, micima thzo thzaa thsikiwa ko thsiya thsito.<verse eid="2CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Uno honi munu yoihe a thsiurukera kwa Fumu, ethso thsito thsaa tundithsiwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Honi Fumu po Mupepo, karo popahe apa pa di Mupepo wa Fumu, ko ku di kurukuruka. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Mweyo, twahe atwe na tu thsikuriwa thsiya thsito ku rupara, twaa monithsa kutethzima kwa Fumu, o ku tu piruriwa mu thsikupuro thsenthzi ko kutethzima oku ku thza o kura oku ku tunderera kwa Fumu, aye Mupepo.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="rem">AM, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Rufumo ro mwoyo mu tunyungu toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nyambi ko ñeke thzenthzi naa tu pa eyi ekwama, mweyo, tumba tu huka munyima. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Tu na kana enu yo ku mukunda nenu yo ku fithsa honyi, ka tu tendire dinyanyamena nji ku tengurura diywi dya Nyambi. Uno honi, twaa monithsa oshemwa thsitonwameho no ku pa ombangi twathsinda ku mumoneno o munu no munu pa meho a Nyambi.<verse eid="2CO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ngeci Muthzimbu Ouwa ou tu honga waa thsikiwa, wa thsikiwa pohuma kowa cithzira. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Aa kana ku tawa, inene Satana, aye nyambi o kano kaye o neraurithsa maano o ci a mona mwethzi o Muthzimbu Ouwa ou u monithsa kutethzima kwa Krisitu, aye thsikupuro thsa Nyambi.<verse eid="2CO 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ka tu hongangire yetu twathsinda, unone twaa honga ci Yesu Krisitu po Fumu, atwe po twapikenu mukaci ka Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Inene Nyambi oyu wa ambire ci: “Mwethzi u muneke mu mirema”, yo wa munekire mu micima thzetu ku tu pa mwethzi odimukero o kutethzima kwa Nyambi oku ku monahara mu rupara rwa Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Unone atwe po tu di noru rufumo mu tufuma toma, ku monithsa ci okoro o ku piterera po wa Nyambi kadi wetu.<verse eid="2CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Twaa thsinenekiwa kokuhe, unone ka tu topwerire. Tu na karupera nene, uno honi ka tu pwererire okurupero. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Twaa nyandithsiwa, unone Nyambi ka a tu thsiererire. Twaa huweriwa pashi, unone kwithsa kunongithsiwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Thsikati thsothsihe twaa shimbanga kufa kwa Yesu mwirama yetu ci mwoyo wenthzi u monahare mwirama yetu.<verse eid="2CO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Inene atwe tu yoya twa ekaranga mwikarupa yo kufa mukaci ka Yesu, ci mwoyo wenthzi u monahare mwirama yetu yo ku twethsa kufa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Uno honi kufa kwaa kwama mu mwetu, mwoyo ao waa kwama mu mwenu.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ku na ñoriwa ci: “Ni na amba, inene ni na tawa.” Pakuninga ci tu di noo mupepo o thsitawo, twaa tawa, karo mweyo twaa amba. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Tu na dimuka ci Nyambi oyu wa pindurire Fumu Yesu kwafu, kenge mba a tu pindura natwe kwafu pofoci na Yesu, no ku tu reta atwe namwe pa meho enthzi. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Eyi yoihe yaa tendiwa mukaci kenu ci thsihemo thsa Nyambi ethsi thsi kuma kwanu owangiangi, thsi vurithse okanderero o ku shangara kutethzima kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku yoya ko thsitawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Mweyo, kadi twakwa ku huka munyima, shaanga ci erama yetu yaa thza o pwa, myoyo thzetu thzaa hemuniwa diyuwa no diyuwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Inene makando etu po a rethzu karo a mu thsikati thsothsipu. Kenge a ku tu retera kutethzima koshokuru ko diyere ko kupita ao makando oahe. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Mweyo, ka tu kengererire enu yo ku moniwa, uno honi twaa kengerera enu i shimoniwa, inene enu yo ku moniwa ya kwikara thsikati thsothsipu, unone enu i shimoniwa ya kwikara diyere.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="rem">AM, MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Inene tu na dimuka ci ngeci athzo tende omu tu yoya muno mu kaye athzopo thzi umbururiwa, tu di no nthzio kwa Nyambi, nthzio thzo diyere thzo mu wiru ethzi thza kana ku umbiwa ko moko anu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Omu mu tende tu di, twaa shira no ku fota nene ci nga tu na vatekiwa mu nthzio thzetu thzo ku wiru. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Mukaci ko ku vatekiwa kengeyo, ka twa ku waniwa o ku tu di thsisheshe. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Uno honi uno tu yoya omu mu tende thzo muno mu kaye, twaa shira no ku remena. Kadi ci ngwa twaa fota ku shupuriwa eyi erama yo muno mu kaye, unone twaa fota ku vatekiwa mwirama yo ku wiru, ci thso ku twethsa ku fa mwoyo u thsi mine. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Nyambi yodiyo wa tu roithserire eyi enu mwene, wa tu pire Mupepo wenthzi ci ikare thsitanarithso.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Mweyo, twaa kurupera thsikati thsothsihe no ku dimuka ci uno tu di mwirama yo muno mu kaye, kure tu di na Fumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Inene twaa enda ko kutawa kadi ko kumona. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Twaa tawa shemwa no ku fota ci nga tu na thsii eyi erama yo muno mu kaye no ku kekara ku diumbo na Fumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Mweyo, thsishima thsetu peuru thzenu yoihe po ku roerithsa Nyambi, ikare o ku tu di mweyino erama yo muno mu kaye nji yo ku wiru. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Inene twahe twaa roera ku kemana pa rupara ro thsipura thso ratwero thsa Krisitu, ci munu no munu a tambure ethsi thsi na roera eyi naa tende o ku di mwirama yo muno mu kaye, ikare yoiwa nji yoimango.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kucihuthsa na Nyambi mwa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Pakuninga ci tu na dimuka ci ku yapa Fumu ne ine, twaa karaethza anu amweya ci a tawe. Nyambi po aa tu dimuka nawa, karo naa kurupera ci namwe mu na i cidimukera nawa ko mumoneno wenu. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Ka tu cishangarire twathsinda ku kwenu, unone twaa mi pa ndau thzo ku cinuneka mukaci ketu, ci mu twethse ku tawa awa cinuneka mwinu yo ku twethsa ku mona kupita ku cinunekera enu eyi i di mu mucima. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ngeci yaa monahara ci twaa thzaruka, twaekara kengeyo mukaci ka Nyambi. Uno honi ngeci tu di nawa mu maano twaekara kengeyo mukaci kenu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Thsishimo thsa Krisitu thsaa tu endithsa, inene twaa rakwa ci munu yofoci wa fererire anu wahe, mweyo anu wahe a fire mu kufa kwenthzi. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Karo wa fererire anu wahe ci awa yoya a ciyoyera athsinda karo, unone a yoyere oyu wa wa fererire, karo wa pinduriwire kwafu.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Mweyo, ku tunda pano ka tu shimbire munu konu. Shaanga ci dyo twa shimbire Krisitu konu, pano honi ka tu mu shimbire kengeyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Mweyo, ngeci munu mwa Krisitu a di, o na piruka thsumbiwa thsothsipe, enu yo kare i na pu, karo enu yoihe i na piruka yoipe.<verse eid="2CO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Eyi yoihe yaa tunda kwa Nyambi oyu naa tu huthsera ku kwenthzi mwa Krisitu, no ku tu pa ekwama yo ku huthsera anu amweya ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Nyambi shime a huthserire kaye ku kwenthzi mwa Krisitu, ko kukana ku varera anu mirandu thzo, karo naa tu pa ekwama yo muthzimbu o ku cihuthsa nenthzi. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Mweyo, atwe po twemaneni a Krisitu, Nyambi aa cikwathsithsa atwe ku adikanena anu. Twaa mi romba shemwa mu dithzina dya Krisitu ci mu cihuthse na Nyambi. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Krisitu ka a tendire thsivi, unone Nyambi wa mu tendire o thsivi mukaci ketu, ci mu mwenthzi twikare owawawa pa meho a Nyambi.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="rem">AM, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Ko kwikara awa kwamena pofoci na Nyambi, twaa mi adikanena ci mwa tambura thsihemo thsa Nyambi mu kengekenge.<verse eid="2CO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Nyambi a amba ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Na ni ku yuvu mu thsikati ethsi thsi na roera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Na ni ku kwathsa mu diyuwa dyo kuyoyithsiwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 6:2">O teerere, thsino po thsodiyo thsikati thso thsihemo thsa Nyambi! Dyo rero dyodiyo diyuwa dyo kuyoyithsiwa.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Ka tu pakire thsiparaka mu dikuñwa dyo munu yomuhe, ci ekwama yetu ya shomororiwa. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Uno honi mwinu yoihe eyi tu tenda, twaa monithsa ci yoshemwa twangamba Nyambi. Inene twaa citanarithsa ko ku cithzua micima mu makando, mwiereka no mwikarupa. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Na tu furiwa, ku pakiwa mu kamenga no kwikara mu mikwangarakanyi. Na tu kwamithsiwa nene, ku cithzua mathsiku o kukana ku rara turo no mu nthzara. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Twaa cimonithsa twathsinda kokenu wetu, kodimukero wetu, ko kukwatamicima kwetu, ko thsihemo thsetu, ko Mupepo Oukenu no thsishimo thsetu thso shemwa. <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Twaa honga muthzimbu oshemwa kokoro wa Nyambi. Owawa thsodiyo thsirwithso thsetu thso ku rwithsa no ku ciamwena. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Twaa kwamena Nyambi, ikare ci anu aa tu remeka nji aa tu shwahura, nji anu aa amba omango ku kwetu nji aa tu shangara. Twaa amba yoshemwa, unone twaa shimbiwa ci twakwa kwangera. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Twaa dimukiwa nene, unone twaa shimbiwa eci ka tu dimukiwire. Twaa yoya unone twaa shimbiwa eci twaa fa. Twaa furiwa, unone kadi twakwa ku paiwa. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Shaanga ci twaa yuvithsiwa kukora ku micima, uno honi thsikati thsothsihe twaa nyanyuka. Twaa monahara ohepwe, unone twaa fumithsa anu owangi. Twaa monahara eci anu o kupira thsimweya, unone tu di nenu yoihe.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Amwe mwakwa Korinte, tu na amba ku kwenu enu yoihe ko kukana ku horeka thsimweya. Tu na mi yanthzurwera micima thzetu. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ka tu thzi mi yanthzererire, unone yamwe mu na tu yanthzerera micima thzenu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Uno honi naa amba ku kwenu eci naa amba nanange, mu yanthzurure nene micima thzenu namwe.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tembere thza Nyambi oyu yoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Mwa paniwa ku njoko thzofoci nakwakukana ku tawa. Inene owawa nomango ne ngepi nga i kwamena pofoci? Nji thsiciwano mwine ethsi nga wikara nathso mwethzi no mirema? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kuciyuva mwine nga kwikara mu kaci ka Krisitu na Satana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beliari.</char></note>? Thsiciwano mwine nga thsikara mu kaci ka mukwakutawa na mukwakukana kutawa? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Karo tembere thza Nyambi ne ngepi nga thzi twethsa ku ciyuva nekupuro yo mathzimu. Inene yatwe twa tembere thza Nyambi oyu yoya. Eci edi a i ambire Nyambi ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Kenge na ku yoyano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">no ku enda pa kaciko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Kenge na kwikara Nyambi wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">karo kenge a kwikara anuange.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Mweyo, Fumu a amba ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“Mu tunde kukwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">mu citepe kukwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">mwa kwata yo dithziro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">mbeci nga ni mi tambure.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Karo kenge na kwikara Tata wenu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">karo kenge mwa kwikara anange wakwerume nambuyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">eyi yodiyo a amba aye Fumu Shokoro Ouhe.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="rem">AM, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Ashimiwa ange, pakuninga ci tu di neyi ekumbwethzo, tu cikenithsenu kwinu yo ku thsireka erama no mupepo, ci twikare anu owakenu nene no ku yoya ko ku yapa Nyambi.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsinyanyu thsa Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Mu tu thsiere ndau mu micima thzenu. Kwithsa oyu na twipithsera, karo kwithsa oyu na twipithsa, nji ku kupakupa munu. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ka ni ambire eyi ci ni mi shomorore. Na ni mi ambera pa kutanga ci mu micima thzetu mu di, mweyo, pofoci tu di mu kuyoya nji mu kufa. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ni na mi kurupera nene! Naa cinuneka mukaci kenu! Ni na tanara mucima mwikarupera yetu yoihe, mane naa rearea ko thsinyanyu.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Inene shaanga ou na tu na kumu mu Masedonia, ka na tu turumwithsa. Unone twa karuperire mu mandau oahe, mukaci ko ku cikanyeka nanu amweya no ku yapa mu micima thzetu. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Unone Nyambi oyu na tanarithsanga micima thzowa a na kendiwa, wa tanarithsire micima thzetu ko kukuma kwa Tite. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Karo ka na tu tanarithsiwa micima ko kukuma kwenthzi pohuma, unone nou twa yuvire muthzimbu wenthzi o ku tu tongwera edi mwa mu tanarithsire mucima. Na a tu tongwera nedi mu na ni ruru, neyi yo thsidiro thsenu, neyi yo ku ni shima nene kwenu. Mweyo, ni na nyanyuka nene ku piterera.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Inene shaanga ci diñoro edi na ni mi ñorera na di mi yuvithsa kukora ku micima, ka ni i cerire. Na i cerire pa kutanga, inene naa mona ci na di mi yuvithsa kukora ku micima diya diñoro, uno honi mu thsikati thsothsipu pohuma. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Pano honi ni na nyanyuka nene, kadi cingwa mukaci ko kuninga ci na ni mi yuvithsa kukora ku micima, unone pakuninga ci kukora kwenu ku micima na ku mi retera kucera. Inene na mu yuvu kukora ku micima eci edi naa i shimi Nyambi, mweyo, kwithsa ethsi na tu mipithsera shaanga kamanana. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Inene aya mathsiwa enu Nyambi naa cikwathsithsa ku mi retera kucera ci mu yoyithsiwe ko kukana ku i cera. Unone kukora ku micima ko mu kaye po kwaa reta kufa.<verse eid="2CO 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Mu mone eyi na a kwama Nyambi ko mathsiwa enu! Muooto wenu, ku monithsa kwenu ci ka mu di no murandu, kushomorora kwenu enu yoimango, kuanthzipa kwenu, kuyapa kwenu, kurura kwenu, no ku shima nene kwenu maano no ku pa humbithso awa nepithsa. Mweyi enu yoihe mwaa monithsa ci ka mu di no murandu. Mweyo yoihe eyo mwaa monithsa ci ka na mwikara no murandu omu mwiamba. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Uno honi ou na ni mi ñorera kadi cingwa mukaci koyu na epithsa nji oyu na epithseriwa, unone shime na ni mi ñorera ci mu twethse ku mona nawa pa meho a Nyambi ku cipaka nene kwenu ku kwetu. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Mweyo, twaa tanarithsiwa micima.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Uno honi ka tu tanarithsiwire micima pohuma, nene po twaa nyanyuka nene pa ku mona thsinyanyu thsa Tite, edi na mu twethsa ku mu yooyerithsa mwahe. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Na ni cishangara ku kwenthzi mukaci kenu, karo ka na mu ni fithsa honyi. Unone eci edi na tu mi ambera oshemwa, no kucishangara kwetu kwa Tite na ku monithsa oshemwa. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Uno honi thsishimo thsenthzi ku kwenu thsaa thza o kura kokoro o ku anekera kuyuvera kwenu mwahe, nomu na mu mu tambwera ko kuyapa no ku tutuma. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Ni na nyanyuka nene honi, inene ni di nokurupero o kuyara mu mwenu.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="rem">MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Ekunda yakwakutawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Andengenu, twaa fota ci mu dimuke yo thsihemo thsa Nyambi edi na thsi cimonaharithsa mu makereke o mu Masedonia. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Inene akwakutawa na erekiwa nene mu makando aa nekara nao. Unone shime na nyanyuka nene, shaanga ci ekarire ahepwe nene na pa kongi.<verse eid="2CO 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci na pa nene, mane ku piterera omu nga twethsera ku pa. Na pa keshima yo. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Na tu adikanena nene ku tu romba ci tu wa tende nawa ku wa tawethza ku kwathsa akwakutawa. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Na tende ku piterera omu na tu kuruperera! Shime na tanga tango ku cipa athsinda kwa Fumu, mbeci a cipe ku kwetu keshima ya Nyambi.<verse eid="2CO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Mweyo, na tu adikanena Tite oyu naa tateka eyi ekwama yo thsihemo mu kaci kenu ci na i manenene. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Uno honi eci edi mu di ci mwafumanyi mwinu yoihe, mu thsitawo, mu kuamba, mudimukero, mwishima yenu yo ku kwathsa, no mu thsishimo ethsi mu tu shima; mu mone ci mwaa tenda nene nawa nomu mu thsihemo thso kupa.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ka ni mi tuminine, unone naa mi monithsa edi naa i pakera maano makereke amweya ci ni mone orurami o thsishimo thsenu.<verse eid="2CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Inene mu na dimuka thsihemo thsa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu. Shaanga ci wa fumine nene, wa pirukire hepwe mukaci kenu, ci kohepwe wenthzi a mi fumithse.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Muanekerero wange mweyi enu po ou. Makomwa po yamwe na mwikara o kutanga, kadi mu kupa pohuma unone no mu ku shima ku tenda kengeyo. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Pano honi, mu manenene ekwama eyi na mu tateka! Mu takamithse ku i manenena eci edi mwa i cekire ku matatekero. Karo mu pe kokuthza keyi mu di nayo. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Inene ngeci ociroithsero ko u di, Nyambi aa tambura ko thsinyanyu kokuthza kethsi a di nathso munu, kadi ethsi a na piri. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Kadi ci ngwa twaa fota ci mu kwathse amweya amwe no ku cithsia mu dikando, unone twaa fota ci mu tende komu ku na roera. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Yoingi eyi mu di nayo mo thsino thsikati yaa roera ku kwathsa awa na piri, ci peunthza namwe ou mwa kupira a ku mi kwathse neyi yoingi a kwikara nayo. Mweyo, enu yoihe kenge ya ku enderera nawa. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Eci edi ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">“Koyu wa wanine nene, kwithsa ethsi thsa thsiarirepo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 8:15">Karo oyu wa wanine yoipu, kwithsa eyi a pirire.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tite naenthzenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Twaa kanderera kwa Nyambi, oyu naa retithsa ci Tite a mi pakere maano ko ku mi kwathsa eci atwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Inene Tite ka naa tawa pohuma eyi na tu mu rombo, unone aye ko ku shima nene ku kwathsa, aa keya oko ku kwenu ko ku shima kwenthzi. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Twaa mi tumena Tite no muenthzetu yumweya oyu na shangariwa nene mu makereke oahe kekwama yenthzi yo ku honga Muthzimbu Ouwa. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Kadi eyo pohuma, unone makereke yodiyo naa hangura ci a ende netu o ku tu twara ethsi thsikunda thso thsihemo. Twaa tenda kengeyo ku shangara kutethzima kwa Fumu aye thsinda no ku monithsa ku shima nene kwetu ku kwathsa anu amweya.<figure style="fig" alt="Gift for the poor in Judea" file="cn02149c.tif" size="col" loc="2 Cor 8:16-19" copy="Cook" ref="8.16-19">Thsikunda kwahepwe o mu Judea</figure><verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Twaa tenda ko ku mamera nene ci twa shomororiwa komu tu kwamena ethsi thsikunda thsothsikuru. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Inene eyi tu fota atwe po ku tenda yoiwa, kadi pa meho a Fumu pohuma, unone no pa meho anu wahe.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Twaa mi tumena karo muenthzetu yumweya pofocino, oyu naa cimonithsa rorungi mu makuñwa oangi ci na pakerako maano nene maano, pano honi na pandakana ku pakerako mukaci ko ku mi kurupera nene. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Tite po muenthzange, karo aa kwamena pofoci nange ku mi kwathsa. Eciko awo aenthzetu amweya awa a mu thsindekethza po aemanena makereke, karo aa reta direma kwa Krisitu. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Mweyo, mu wa monithse thsishimo thsenu, ci ikare ombangi ku makereke ku monithsa ci kucishangara kwetu mukaci kenu po kwa shemwa.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="rem">MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Ku kwathsa akwakutawa amweya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ka ku fotaharire ci ni mi ñorere karo keyi yo ku tumena ekwathsa aenthzetu akwakutawa o mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Inene ni na dimuka ci namwe mwakwa ku shima nene ku kwathsa, karo naa cishangaranga kwanu o mu Masedonia mukaci kenu. Na ni wa tongawera ci ku tatekera makomwa amwe mwanu o mu Akaya na mu ciroithsera ku kwathsa. Mane ku shima nene kwenu ku kwathsa na ku nyangumuna anu owangi kukwo.<verse eid="2CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Unone naa mi tumena awo aenthzetu amweya ci kucishangara kwetu keyi yenu kwekara ko mbango, unone na wane ci mu na ciroithsera shemwa eci edi na ni i wa tongawera. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Inene ngeci o na ku keye nakwa Masedonia no ku na wana ci ka na mu ciroithsera, ka twa ku na amba thsimweya keyi yenu, unone kenge twa ku na fa pohuma honyi mukaci ko ku mi kurupera nene. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Uno honi na ni mono ci ku di nawa ku karaethza awo aenthzetu ci a citangethze oko na roithse eyi na mu kumbwethza ku pa. Ou na ku na kuma, naa fota ci na ku na wane enu yoihe o ku i na roo, ci ku monahare ci mwaa pa ko kushima kadi ko ku ooteriwa.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Mwa vurama ci o ku kuna yoipu kenge a ku cora yoipu. Unone o ku kuna yoingi kenge a ku cora yoingi. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Mweyo, munu no munu ku kwenu aa roera ku pa komu a na anekerera mu mucima wenthzi, kadi ku pa ko ku tatoka nji ku ooteriwa, inene Nyambi po wa ku shima o ku pa o ku na nyanyuka. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Nyambi aa twethsa ku mi monithsa thsihemo thsothsihe, ci mwinu yoihe thsikati thsothsihe mwikare nenu yoihe eyi i na fotahara, mane mwikare neyi yoingi yo ku twethsa ku mi kwathsa mwikwama yoihe yoiwa. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Eci edi ku na ñoriwa ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Aa pa ahepwe kengekenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">owawa wenthzi kenge wa kwikara diyere.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Nyambi oyu na panga anjimi mbuto no makende o ku dya, kenge a ku mi pa no ku vurithsa mbuto thzenu thzo ku kuna, karo kenge a ku kurithsa dicora dyenu dyowawa.<verse eid="2CO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Kenge mwa ku fumithsiwa mu makuñwa oahe ci mwa ku twethse ku kwathsa thsikati thsothsihe, ci anu owangi a ku kanderere kwa Nyambi keyi mu wa pa ko ku cikwathsithsa atwe. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Inene eyi ekwama yenu yo ku kwathsa, ka i kwathsire pohuma anua Nyambi awa a na piri, unone yaa reta kongi erombero yokanderero kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="2CO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Mukaci kekwama yenu eyi na mu monithsa, anu amweya kenge a ku shangara Nyambi. Mukaci ko ku hengeka kwenu Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Krisitu ou mwa tawire, no kupa kwenu mu kucitaperano namweya kengeyo. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Karo kenge a ku mi romberera no ku fota nene ci nga na mi mono, mukaci ko thsihemo thsa Nyambi thsothsikuru ethsi naa mi pa. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Ku kandereriwe kwa Nyambi mukaci kokuru o thsipa thsenthzi thso kukana ku twethsa ku tongononiwa.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="rem">MN, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa citawera kekwama yenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Uno honi ame no Paulu naa mi romba ko ku cihuthsa kushi no kuwamucima kwa Krisitu, ame ni na ombapanga o ku ni di nenu, unone o ku ni di kokure nenu naa karupanga! <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Naa mi adikanena pano ci ou na ku keya oko na ku na karupa kowa a anekera ci twaa yoya eci anu o kano kaye.<verse eid="2CO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Inene shaanga ci twaa yoya muno mu kaye, ka tu rwire mvo konu. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Erwithsa eyi tu rwithsa po kadi cingwa erwithsa yo kano kaye, unone erwithsa yokoro wa Nyambi yo ku twethsa ku umburura yoshokoro. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Twaa umburura makanyi nenu yoihe eyi i rwithsa odimukero wa Nyambi, karo twaa pukura eanekera yoihe ci i yuvere Krisitu. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Karo tu na ciroithsera ku na pa humbithso akwa mukanayuva wahe, kuyuvera kwenu ou kwa ku kwanenena.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Mwaa shimba enu ko mimonaharero. Ngeci munu yumweya aa tawa shemwa ci wa Krisitu, a dimuke kenge ci dyodi a di aye ci wa Krisitu natwe dyo tu di. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Mweyo, ka ni fire honyi shaanga yame ni cishangara mukaci kokoro ou naa tu pa Fumu ci tu mi umbe kadi ku mipithsa.<verse eid="2CO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Ka ni fotire ku monahara eci naa mi yapithsa ko mañoro ange. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Inene amweya aa amba ci: “Mañoro a Paulu a remu karo akoro, unone o ku di netu po wa ku faratera karo no maywi enthzi a shwahuki.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Anu o kengeyo aa roera ku dimuka ci kwithsa apa i na cithsiera eyi tu na ñoranga mu mañoro o ku tu na piriko neyi tu na tendanga o ku tu di nenu.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Atwe po ka tu keshukire ku cishangara twathsinda nji ku cipiturithsa namweya awa na cishangaranga athsinda. Uno honi yoihe a cianekethza athsinda namweya no ku cifekithsa athsinda namweya, kadi anyanyami.<verse eid="2CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Eciko atwe po kucishangara kwetu po ka tu cishangarangire ku piterera apa tu na roera ku kuma. Unone atwe twaa cishangara ko kukana ku rea mainthza ekwama yetu eyi naa tu pa Nyambi, ku pakerera kengeyo namwe. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Inene atwe ka tu citwaratwarire ku cishangara, mane eci ka twa na kumine oko ku kwenu. Inene atwe yatwe twa tangire ku keya ku kwenu ku mi retera Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Krisitu.<verse eid="2CO 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Mweyo, ka tu hambakanine ku cishangara kekwama eyi na kwama amweya. Unone twaa kurupera ci dyodi thsi kura thsitawo thsenu, nekwama yetu nga dyo i yanduruka nene mu kaci kenu, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />ci tu twethse ku ka honga Muthzimbu Ouwa no mandau amweya aa a di ku thsambwedyo thzenu. Inene ka tu fotire ci tu cishangare kekwama eyi na i tendiwa kare mu ndau thzo munu yumweya. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Unone eci edi ku na ñoriwa ci: “Oyu cishangara a cishangare mwa Fumu.”<verse eid="2CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Inene kadi munu o ku cishangara yothsinda yo na tawethziwa, unone oyu a na shangara Fumu.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="rem">ML, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu no tunganda to mbango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Kadi edi ni na foto ci nga mwaa ni kunda kamanana potomba wange, mu adikane mu ni kunde! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Inene naa mi tendera difupa ko difupa dya Nyambi pakuninga ci na mi ungekethzithsire kwa mukwerume yofoci, aye Krisitu, ci nga na ku mi pe ku kwenthzi eci mumbanda o mukenu. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Uno honi naa yapa ci eci dyodi dyangerire diyoka Eva ko dinyanyamena, neanekera yenu dyoya ku pambana ku thsia kucipaka kwenu ko shemwa nokenu kwa Krisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Inene ngeci munu aa keya ku na mi honga yo Yesu wao, ku thsia oyu twa mi hongire, nji ngeci mwaa tambura mupepo wao ku thsia ou mwa tamburire, nji muthzimbu wao ku thsia ou mwa tamburire, mwaa i tawa wanguwangu.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ame ka ni cishimbire nothsinda ci no muonye koto tunganda totukuru mu thsivaka. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Shaanga ci ka ni di noñurungu mu kuamba, uno honi ni di nodimukero. Eyo na tu i mi monithsa nawanawa mu makuñwa oahe.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ene shime na tendire thsivi uya na cihuthsire kushi ci nga mu thzinekiwe, inene na hongire Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Nyambi ku kwenu kengekenge? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Na pukurire makereke amweya pa ku tambura ekunda yo ku na mi kwathsa. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Karo uya na nekarire oko ku kwenu ku ni na piri, ka na na pire munu mupango. Inene aenthzetu mu thsitawo o ku Masedonia wodiyo a ni kwathsire ku ni retera yoihe eyi na pirire. Shime na tendire kengeyo ci nekara mupango ku kwenu, karo kenge na ku twarerera ku tenda kengeyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Pakuninga ci oshemwa wa Krisitu mu mwange u di, oku kucishangara kwange kwithsa oyu wa ku ku kwangithsa mu ditunga dyodihe dya Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Ine eyi ni ambera kengeyo? Ene ka ni mi shimine nji? Nyambi na dimuka ci naa mi shima!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Uno honi eyi ni tenda kenge na ku twarerera ku i tenda ci na ku kwangithse awa fota ku cishangarerapo no ku amba ci ekwama yo yaa cishoka neyi yetu. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Inene anu o kengeyo po tunganda to mbango, akwekwama yo kwangera, karo aa cimonaharithsa eci tunganda twa Krisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ka i komokithsire, inene shaanga Satana aa cimonithsanga yothsinda kwikara eci kangeru ko mwethzi. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Mweyo, ka i komokithsire ngeci angambenthzi nawo aa cimonithsa eci angamba owawawa. Unone ku hura kenge a ku tambura humbithso ethzi thzi na roera etenda yo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makando a Paulu pa kwikara kanganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Naa hukerapo kuamba ci, munu a anekera ci no thsitomba. Unone ngeci mwaa tenda kengeyo, mu ni shimbe eci no thsitomba ci name nga ni cishangare kamanana. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Kucishangara ko kenge po kadi cingwa kwaa tunda kwa Fumu, unone naa tenda eci thsitomba. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Pakuninga ci anu owangi aa cishangara konu, name kenge ni cishangara. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Inene amwe mwaa anekera ci mwanyanyami, unone mwaa nyanyuka ku kunda etomba! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Mane mwaa kunda munu yomuhe o ku mi pikura, nji ku mi nyanga eyi mu di nayo, nji ku miangera, nji ku mi shwahura, nji ku mi mbandura pa rupara. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Naa amba ko honyi ci shime twa faraterire nene ku tenda kengeyo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Uno honi thsothsihe ethsi a keshuka munu ku cishangarera, name thsodiyo ni keshuka ku cishangarera. Naa amba kengeyo eci thsitomba. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Ene Maheveru nji? Name no Muheveru. Ene Maisiraele nji? Name no Muisiraele. Ene anahoka a Aburahama nji? Name no mwanahoka wa Aburahama. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Ene angamba Krisitu nji? Ame naa wa pita. Naa amba eci munu o ku thzaruka, inene na kwamine nene ku wa pita, no ku pakiwa mu kamenga rorungi. Karo na furiwire miendo thzo kukana ku pwa ku tariwa, no ku fotanga ku fa rorungi. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Shime na furiwire miendo thzo mutanu ku Majuda tumwashumwashu to ku kuma mu makumi ahatu no mutanu na ane. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Na furiwire no miramu miendo thzihatu no ku povauriwa no mawe rofoci. Shime na rowerire no dingunde miendo thzihatu, karo na shimbire rofoci othsiku ouhe no diyuwa mutumbi o ku ni di mu meyu. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Mu miendo thzange thzothzingi, kuma nekarangire mwikarupa. Mwikarupa yo mu marware, mwikarupa yo mapuku, mwikarupa eyi ya tundererire kwaenthzange Majuda no ku kwAnukenge, mwikarupa yo mu mambongi no mu makunguthsitu, mwikarupa yo mu mawate, no mwikarupa ku tunderera kwakwakutawa o mbango. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Na kwamine nene no ku nyanda. Karo na kuñwerangire rorungi othsiku ouhe kwithsa ku rara. Na fangire nthzara no dinotwa, na pirangire edya rorungi. Karo na fangire mepo mukaci ko kupira thso ku cithsika.<verse eid="2CO 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Kadi eyo pohuma, unone diyuwa no diyuwa naa remena mukaci ko ku cithzekera yo makereke oahe. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ngeci yumweya aa faratera, name naa ciyuva ku faratera. Karo ngeci yumweya aa twariwa mu thsivi, naa ciyuva eci mu mudiro ni di mukaci kenthzi.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Ngeci naa cishangara naa roera ku cishangara kokuthza komu ku na monaharera kufaratera kwange. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Aye Nyambi Tata wa Fumu Yesu, aye oyu shangariwa diyere, na dimuka ci ka niangerire. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ou nekarire mu Damaseka, nguvuru wa Fumu Aretasi shime a tuminine maporithsa ci ekare pa mathsero o mbongi ci a ni kwate. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Uno honi na shurumweniwire ko diyongo mu njaneno thzo pa dimota dyo mbongi no ku para mu moko enthzi.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="rem">ML, MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Thsimona thsa Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Kenge ni twarerera ku cishangara. Shaanga ikare ci kwithsa thso ku wanapo, kenge ni twarerera ku amba yemona nehokora eyi na i tundu kwa Fumu. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ni na dimuka Mukrisitu yumweya oyu wa twariwire ku diwiru dyo muthsihatu. Na ku piti pohuma myaka thzo dikumi na thzine ku tunda apa ya tendaharerire. Ka ni dimuka nawa nji shime a twariwire nerama yenthzi nji kadi nerama, Nyambi yodiyo na i dimuka. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Karo ni na dimuka ci oyu munu shime a twariwire mu paradaisi. Unone ka ni dimuka nji shime a twariwire nerama nji kadi nerama, Nyambi yodiyo na i dimuka. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Wa comboriwerire ku paradaisi oku a ka yuvire maywi o kukana ku twethsa ku a tongonona munu, karo kwithsa munu oyu na tawethziwa ku a amba.<verse eid="2CO 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Kenge ni cishangara mukaci ko munu o kengeyo kadi ku cishangara mukaci kange nothsinda, unone naa twethsa pohuma ku cishangara keyi yo ku faratera kwange. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Shaanga nga o ni fote ci ni cishangare, nga ka nikara thsitomba, inene kenge nga ni amba yoshemwa. Uno honi ka na ku i tenda, inene ka ni fotire ci munu a ni shimbe kokuru ku piterera eyi a mona o ku ni tenda, nji eyi a yuva oku ni amba. <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Mweyo, ci na cishangara mukaci keyi ehokora yoikuru nene kupiterera, na ni piwa muunga mwirama yange, ako kanganda ka Satana ku na ni yuvithsa kukora ci na cishangara.<verse eid="2CO 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Miendo thzihatu o ku ni adikanena nene Fumu ci a i tundithse ku kwange. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Unone aye wa ni tawire ci: “Thsihemo thsange thsi na ku kwana, inene okoro wange waa kwama nawa nene mu kufaratera.” Mweyo, kenge ni nyanyuka nene o ku ni cishangara mukaci ko kufaratera kwange ci okoro wa Krisitu wikare pa pange. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Mweyo, mukaci ka Krisitu, naa nyanyuka mu kufaratera, mu matuka, mu makando, mu kunyandithsiwa, no mukaru ouhe. Inene yoihe ni faratera mbeci ni tanare.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ecoyoka ya Paulu kwAkwaKorinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Na nikara eci thsitomba, unone yamwe na mu ni retithsera ci nikare kengeyo. Yamwe na mu roera ku pa ombangi keyi yange. Inene kadi no muonye o mamaneneno kotu tunganda twenu totukuru mu thsivaka, shaanga i ninge ci no thsikura. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Yoshemwa, emonithso nekomokithsa, nekwama yoikoro yo ku monithsa ci no kanganda shemwa, na i tendiwa ku kwenu ko mucima outhzui. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Mwinu mwine omu na ni kana ku mi tenda nawa kupita makereke amweya, shime pohuma yo kukana kwikara mupango ku kwenu? Mu ni kwatereko pa kwipithsa kengeyo.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Pano honi ni na ciroithsera ku na mi hungerithsa ro muthsihatu, ka ni fotire ku nekara mupango ku kwenu. Inene ka ni fotire eyi mu di nayo unone naa fota amwe. Shaanga ikare kengeyo, ana ka roerire ku rera ashemi wo, unone ashemi wodiyo a na roera ku rera ano. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Eci ame po ni na nyanyuka ku pa yoihe eyi ni di nayo, mane no ku cipa nothsinda mukaci kenu. Ngeci ame naa mi shima nene, ene amwe ne kenge mu ni shima kamanana nji?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Shaanga ikare kengeyo, ka na nikara mupango ku kwenu. Unone amweya a anekera ci nekarire no dinyanyamena no ku mi kwatakwata pa meho. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Unone ngepi? Ene shime na ni mi pupirika kowa na ni mi tumithsera nji? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Shime na adikanenine Tite ci a keye oko ku kwenu, na mu tumine pofoci na muenthzetu yumweya. Ene Tite ne shime aa na mi pupirika nji ngepi? Dyombo! Inene twaa kwamena pofoci mu Mupepo ofoci, no kwikara no maano ofoci.<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Ene popahe apa mwaa anekeranga ci twaa cimanenanga twathsinda ku kwenu nji? Dyombo, twaa ambanga eyi ko kwikara angamba a Krisitu pa meho a Nyambi. Ashimiwa ange, eyi tu na tendanga yoihe twaa i tenderanga ci mu umbiwe mu thsitawo. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Inene naa yapa ci ou na ku keya oko ka na ku na mi wana o ku mu di eci edi ni na foto, nji amwe ku na ni mona o ku ni di omu mu na kana ku fotera. Karo naa yapa ci kenge na ku na wana dikanyi no mbamba, noanthzi, oñondi, kwipithsa mathzina amweya no ruhopo, mununa, mikwangarakanyi no mikarero thzothzimango. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Naa yapa ci ou na ku keya karo oko Nyambi wange kenge a ku na ni huthsa kushi pa meho enu, karo kenge na ku nekara mu mathsiwa mukaci kowa owangi awa na tende thsivi mwikati yo ku manyima, karo ka na cera ekwama yo yo dithziro, yo ruthziho nongurunde eyi na kwama.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, MN, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Maywi o mahurerero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Oru na ku na mi hungerithsa pano rodiyo ro muthsihatu. Mweyo, naa mi ambera ci: “Thsiamba no thsiamba thsaa roera ku tanarera pombangi wanu aidi nji ahatu,” eci edi i na ñoriwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Na nomenithsire awa a tendire thsivi uya na na mi hungerithsire ro muthsidi. Pano honi naa hukera ku wa nomenithsa mofoci kengeyo namweya wahe. Eci diya na na tendire pa kutanga, ou na ku huka oko ka na ku na wandwa,<verse eid="2CO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />pakuninga ci mwaa fota ombangi o ku monithsa ci Krisitu aa amba kange. Ka a faraterire o ku kwama mu mwenu, unone aa kwama kokoro mu kaci kenu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Inene shime a ambiwire pa mbinda mu kufaratera, uno honi aa yoya kokoro wa Nyambi. Mofoci natwe, twaa faratera mu mwenthzi, uno honi kokoro wa Nyambi kenge twa ku yoya nenthzi o ku tu kwama nenu.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Mu citatufe no ku cifotithsithsa mwathsinda ci mu mone ci thsitawo thsenu ne thsa shemwa. Ene ka mu dimukire ci Yesu Krisitu mu mwenu a di nji? Shime ngeci na mu thsiara ethzo tatufo. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Naa kurupera ci kenge mu wana ci atwe ka tu thsiarire ethzo tatufo.<verse eid="2CO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Twaa rombera kwa Nyambi ci mwa kwipithsa. Kadi cingwa twaa fota ku monithsa ci tu na piti ethzo tatufo, uno honi twaa fota ci mu tende enu eyi i na roera shaanga ci twaa monahara ku thsiara ethzo tatufo. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Inene tumba tu twethsa ku rwithsa oshemwa wa Nyambi unone twaa wimanena. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Inene atwe twaa roera yoihe tu faratera unone amwe mwaa tanarithsiwa. Twaa rombera kwa Nyambi ci mu kurithsiwe mu thsitawo.<verse eid="2CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Yodiyo ni na i mi ñorerera mu diñoro o ku ni na piriko, ci ou na ku keya na ku na mi karupera ko ku cikwathsithsa okoro wange, ao okoro ou naa ni pa Fumu ci mu umbiwe, kadi ku mi umburura.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena ko mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ko ku manenena, andengenu, mu nyanyuke. Mu kure mu thsitawo ko kuyara. Mu citanarithse mu kaci kenu, mu ciyuve mu kaci kenu, no ku yoya mu thsiyaro. Mweyo, Nyambi o thsishimo no thsiyaro kenge a kwikara nenu. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Mu civumenenange ko thsitawo. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Anua Nyambi wahe awa di kuno aa mi vumenena.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Thsihemo thsa Fumu Yesu Krisitu no thsishimo thsa Nyambi, no thsiciwano thso Mupepo Oukenu ikare nenu mwahe.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>